<section class="auth-page"><div class="auth-intro"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR OWN LITTLE CINEMA</p><h1>More stories.<br>Less searching.</h1><p>One place for your watchlist and viewing history.</p></div><div class="auth-card"><h2>Create account</h2><p class="muted">V2 accounts are separate from the original app.</p><form data-auth="register"><label>Username<input name="username" autocomplete="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="80"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="12" maxlength="72"></label><label>Confirm password<input name="confirmPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="12" maxlength="72"></label><p class="muted">Use at least 12 characters.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Create account</button><p class="form-message" role="status"></p></form><p>Already registered? <a href="index.php?v=Login">Sign in</a></p></div></section>
